WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.433
The main points.

2
00:00:01.433 --> 00:00:04.139
Tax is paid in the country of residency,

3
00:00:04.139 --> 00:00:07.861
and almost everywhere a coin-to-coin swap is taxed too.

4
00:00:07.861 --> 00:00:09.823
Every trade must be recorded.

5
00:00:09.823 --> 00:00:13.612
And from 2026 exchanges pass client data to tax offices.

6
00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:17.198
Details for each country are in the module's lessons.
